    "detailed_description": "In the quiet and peaceful grassland, a group of uninvited guests suddenly came!<br />\r\nThey are ordered by Satan to raid the walls of God!<br />\r\nYou have been hired by the gods as a new warrior, sworn to live and die with the wall!<br />\r\nNow, follow the will of God and crush them with your fingers!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010The pleasure of crushing\u3011<br />\r\nUse your fingers to match your hand speed, tap the screen, and crush these monsters!<br />\r\n\u3010Gorgeous match\u3011<br />\r\nYou can encounter dozens of skills, learn them to make you stronger and play more cool special effects!<br />\r\n\u3010Tough leader\u3011<br />\r\nIn addition to crushing mobs, you have to fight against a variety of difficult enemies and smash their plots!<br />\r\n\u3010Advancement of strength\u3011<br />\r\nBy collecting the chalices your strength is permanently enhanced!<br />\r\n\u3010Difficulty of freedom\u3011<br />\r\nYou can choose the enemy's growth path, customize the difficulty of the game, and crush higher-level enemies!",
